gy. gen-golden-set.mjs hit 353 LOC vs a 300 budget so the corpus/criterion/provenance/refilter code moved to scripts/lib/golden-set-build.mjs - a move, not a rewrite, kept separate from golden-set-diagnostics.mjs on purpose. Does NOT unblock condition 4: the sibling-session ambiguity precondition is untouched. Committed 6055634.
