ing embed() into indexing.ts is explicitly U1.3, so row-writing and both row-level checks move there where they become runnable - asked the checker to rule on whether that is right or a unit shrinking its own acceptance criteria. Mongo UNREACHABLE this tick (server selection timed out) so no live claim made about the chunks collection. 392 passing / 0 failing across 8 packages; schema/validate.py PASS 24 collections; typecheck 0; depcruise 0 violations.
